              "text": "Among the certified officinal herbs and the active ingredients that create the Cataplasm there are: collagen and hyaluronic acid to compensate for the decrease in the skin with advancing age and restore elasticity and tone, bromelain to hinder swelling and inflammation, as well as toxins, free radicals, and dead cells; white willow, salicilin, and devil’s claw boast similar properties and are also recommended to reduce migraines and colds. The antioxidant, immunostimulant, antibacterial, and healing actions of boswellia, turmeric, and lavandula against skin imperfections are noteworthy too. Furthermore, camphor acts as a blood circulation, oxygenation, and cellular metabolism stimulant. In the end, ceramides restore the skin barrier and hydration. The ozonization applied to this blend of plant-based oils allows the ozone to be stored in a biological substrate that is highly compatible with the skin, this leads to a significant level of absorption of the active ingredients in the skin, a detoxifying effect on the tissues, and the stimulation of the blood flow. The regenerating, antioxidant, antibacterial, and anti-inflammatory properties of the plants are thus fully exploited. ",
