            {
              "detail": 0,
              "format": 0,
              "mode": "normal",
              "style": "",
              "text": "aqua, solum fullonum, Vitis vinifera seed oil, Butyrospermum Parkii Butter, Polyglyceryl-3 Cetyl Ether Olivate Succinate, Perilla ocymoides seed oil ozonized, linum usitatissimum seed oil ozonized, Avena sativa seed oil ozonized, Glycerin, Linum usitatissimum L. powder, Brassica nigra L. powder, Cetearyl Alcohol, phenoxyethanol, ethylehxylglicerin, Ceramide np, ceramide ap, ceramide eop, phytosphingosine, cholesterol, sodium lauroyl lactylate, carbomer, xanthan gum, collagen, Sodium Hyaluronate, Bromeline, Propylene Glycol, Curcuma longa Root Extract, Harpagophytum procumbens Root Extract, Helichrysum italicum Extract, Ficus carica fruit extract, Boswellia serrata extract, Salix Alba Extract, Mentha piperita oil, Lavandula hybrida grosso herb, Turpentine, Cynnamomum camphora leaf oil, Ascorbyl tetraisopalmitate, Limonene, Linalool, Eugenol, Benzyl Alcohol, Geraniol.",
